"format in more detail. Add to or modify these files to match your needs. You "
"can also create custom schemas through the preferences dialog at <menuchoice>"
"<guisubmenu>Settings</guisubmenu> <guimenuitem>Configure "
"&konsole;...</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."
msgstr ""
